-- **Surface / Model:** <e.g. VS Code Copilot agent mode> / <model as the surface names it, or unknown>
+- **Surface / Model:** <e.g. VS Code Copilot agent mode> / <model as the surface names it, or unknown>; route, when routed: <provider>/<tier> → <model or unknown> (<evidence level>)[; <n> delegated: <role> <provider>/<tier> → <model or unknown> (<evidence level>), …]
