+| Discovery rules | yes | `mergeDiscovery` (listing calls are the host's) | item 6, item 7, item 8 | no; host to implement listing |
+| Pinned attempts | yes | `pinAttempt` | item 11 | no |
+| Escalation, fallback, budget | yes | yes | item 3, item 4, item 10, item 12, item 22 | no |
+| Execution record | yes | `buildExecutionRecord` (storing records is the host's) | item 11, item 14 | no; host to implement storage |
+| Identity evidence levels | yes | `classifyIdentity` | item 13, item 14 | no; host-reported identity depends on each harness |
+| Cost comparison | yes | `cost-compare` | item 15 | no |
+| Lifecycle events | yes | Relay 1.3.0 validators and producer (no viewer change) | item 16, item 17, item 21 | no |
